The campus of a university in the Midlands in 2010 and 2025.
2010: Library; Lecture halls; Science labs; Student halls; Lawn; Sports field; Car park; Main road
2025: Library; Lecture halls; Science labs; Student halls; Student centre; Lawn; New student halls; Multi-storey car park; Cycle store; Bus stop; Main road
Main features: The campus has become more built-up and less green. The sports field in the east has been replaced by new student halls, and half of the central lawn is now a student centre. The surface car park has become a smaller multi-storey car park with a cycle store beside it, and a bus stop has been added by the main road. The library, lecture halls, science labs and original halls are unchanged.', 'The campus has become more built-up and less green. The sports field in the east has been replaced by new student halls, and half of the central lawn is now a student centre. The surface car park has become a smaller multi-storey car park with a cycle store beside it, and a bus stop has been added by the main road. The library, lecture halls, science labs and original halls are unchanged.'),
